1. CI/CD with Docker
CI/CD Kya Hai?
> CI (Continuous Integration)
Developer code ko GitHub me push karta hai aur automatically build/test hota hai.

> CD (Continuous Deployment/Delivery)
Code test hone ke baad automatically server par deploy ho jata hai.
Docker CI/CD Me Kaise Help Karta Hai?
Docker application ko container me package karta hai.
CI/CD pipeline us container ko build aur deploy karti hai.

> Flow
Developer
    ↓
GitHub
    ↓
Jenkins/GitHub Actions
    ↓
Docker Build
    ↓
Docker Image
    ↓
Docker Hub
    ↓
Server Deployment

> Benefits
✅ Fast Deployment
✅ Same Environment
✅ Less Errors
✅ Automation

2. Docker with AWS ☁️
AWS duniya ka sabse popular cloud platform hai.
Docker containers ko AWS par deploy kar sakte hain.

> AWS Services
> EC2
Virtual Machine
Docker EC2 ke andar install hota hai.
// docker run nginx
> ECS (Elastic Container Service)
AWS ki managed container service.
Docker containers ko directly run kar sakte hain.
> EKS (Elastic Kubernetes Service)
AWS ka managed Kubernetes service.
Docker + Kubernetes deployment ke liye.
> ECR (Elastic Container Registry)
Docker images store karne ke liye.
AWS ka Docker Hub.

> Example
Docker Image
     ↓
AWS ECR
     ↓
ECS / EKS
     ↓
Users

