5. Docker + Kubernetes Integration ☸️🐳
Problem
Docker container bana sakta hai.
Lekin agar 100 ya 1000 containers ho jaye to?
Unhe manage kaun karega?

👉 Kubernetes
> Working
Step 1
Docker Application Container banata hai.
// docker build -t myapp .
Step 2
Image Docker Hub ya Registry me push hoti hai.
// docker push myapp
Step 3
Kubernetes image ko pull karta hai.
// kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
Step 4
Kubernetes containers manage karta hai.
